Z||000003||2FAST4U||01-11-2000||09:23 PM||||Cliff, Sorry for your loss, but I know how you feel. The week before Christmas somebody burglarized my house in the middle of the day while I was at work. Kicked in the back door.<BR>All they took was a VCR but in doing so they knocked over my stero rack damaging several pieces of stero equipment plus they just yanked the connections out of the back of the TV instead of unhooking them.<BR>They took a $175.00 VCR but did about a thousand dollars worth of damage while getting it.<BR>I guess I should be glad they were so stupid, instead of the VCR there were many thing in the house that were much more valuable.||||reg||1
