Z||000017||fiero56||01-12-2000||01:07 PM||||Right now I am working at a bicycle shop, and the most common stories people bring in are about how someone just waltzed in their garage and stole a half dozen bikes or so.<P>Back in my junior year in high school during summer vacation I had just woke up from a nap,opened the garage door, and was going out to check for the mail when these two guys jumped back from my Sable(in the driveway, with brand new stero equipment inside), hopped in their old aerostar and tore off down the road. I wasn't even awake enough to realize what was going on until they had already turned the corner in the min-van. If I had realized what they were up to before they left the driveway, I would have been hucking bricks at them(we had just taken the bar out of the basement, and there was a huge pile of bricks next to the door). Probly better I didn't, but my rage gets the best of me sometimes.||||reg||1
